DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
22058::$$$message_0172_0000_0000$$$::   One conclusion.[lr]::
22059::$$$message_0172_0000_0001$$$::In order to defeat her, the enemy that I have yet to see, Lancer's cooperation is essential.[lr]::
22060::$$$message_0172_0000_0002$$$::It's not because I can't cooperate with other Servants.[lr]::
22061::$$$message_0172_0000_0003$$$::Hypothetically, to be able to defeat her...[lr]::
22062::$$$message_0172_0000_0004$$$::It would not be Saber, even more so not me, but it has to be by the hands of that spearman.::
22063::$$$message_0172_0001_0000$$$::"Lancer."[lr]::
22064::$$$message_0172_0001_0001$$$::I call to him.[lr]::
22065::$$$message_0172_0001_0002$$$::These are also a fragment of new days that I haven't seen before.::
22066::$$$message_0172_0002_0000$$$::I unravel the truth to the best of my ability.[lr]::
22067::$$$message_0172_0002_0001$$$::The reenacted Holy Grail War.[lr]::
22068::$$$message_0172_0002_0002$$$::Bazett Fraga McRemitz who continues fighting in this night town.[lr]::
22069::$$$message_0172_0002_0003$$$::That defeating her is the solution to this situation and that Lancer himself, who was her Servant, is the warrior that could lead us to certain victory.::
22070::$$$message_0172_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
22071::$$$message_0172_0003_0001$$$::Lancer is silent.[lr]::
22072::$$$message_0172_0003_0002$$$::Even if I told him the truth, his answer won't change.[lr]::
22073::$$$message_0172_0003_0003$$$::Just like before[line len=3][font color=0x999999]before?[line len=3][rf]he rejects it saying that it doesn't concern him.[lr]::
22074::$$$message_0172_0003_0004$$$::That's why before that,[lr]::
22075::$$$message_0172_0003_0005$$$::"I'll return this to you. This was originally yours, right?"[lr]::
22076::$$$message_0172_0003_0006$$$::I throw the earring that I picked up at the house to him.::
22077::$$$message_0172_0004_0000$$$::[font italic=true][font color=0x9E0326]...Idiot, that's not it.[rf][font italic=false]::
22078::$$$message_0172_0005_0000$$$::"...Where did you find this?[lr]::
22079::$$$message_0172_0005_0001$$$::You hadn't met her yet, right?"[lr]::
22080::$$$message_0172_0005_0002$$$::"Just one was on the floor.[lr]::
22081::$$$message_0172_0005_0003$$$::You haven't been to that house?"[lr]::
22082::$$$message_0172_0005_0004$$$::"I have no need to. Besides, most of all..."[lr]::
22083::$$$message_0172_0005_0005$$$::[font italic=true]Did he not have the time to during the Holy Grail War?[font italic=false]::
22084::$$$message_0172_0006_0000$$$::[font italic=true][font color=0x9E0326]...Damn it, it can't be helped.[rf][font italic=false]::
22085::$$$message_0172_0007_0000$$$::"Well, I'll keep it. Is it okay to give it to me?"[lr]::
22086::$$$message_0172_0007_0001$$$::"That would be the best. Well, to be honest, you're the only one I didn't want to give it back to."[lr]::
22087::$$$message_0172_0007_0002$$$::It's meaningless even if I say such a thing.[lr]::
22088::$$$message_0172_0007_0003$$$::[font italic=true]You see? In other words...[font italic=false]::
22089::$$$message_0172_0008_0000$$$::I return the earring.[lr]::
22090::$$$message_0172_0008_0001$$$::If it won't work even after I set the stage this much, I can't get Lancer's help.[lr]::
22091::$$$message_0172_0008_0002$$$::I'll think of a way to win against her with Saber just like I've been doing[line len=3]::
22092::$$$message_0172_0009_0000$$$::"Fine. What time are we carrying it out?"[lr]::
22093::$$$message_0172_0009_0001$$$::"I'll think[line len=3]wait, [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=800 count=12]whaaaaat!?"[lr]::
22094::$$$message_0172_0009_0002$$$::"What is that? I'm saying that I'll keep you company so tell me what time."[lr]::
22095::$$$message_0172_0009_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
22096::$$$message_0172_0009_0004$$$::[font italic=true]What kind of change in heart is that?[font italic=false][lr]::
22097::$$$message_0172_0009_0005$$$::Lancer agrees to my cooperation request.::
22098::$$$message_0172_0010_0000$$$::"W-Well, that helps. The time is before midnight at the open space of the church..."[lr]::
22099::$$$message_0172_0010_0001$$$::"All right, I'll be ready.[lr]::
22100::$$$message_0172_0010_0002$$$::...Oh, and one condition. I'll get rid of her, so don't interfere. You don't have to bring Saber either.[lr]::
22101::$$$message_0172_0010_0003$$$::I know her fighting style, so it won't even take a minute."[lr]::
22102::$$$message_0172_0010_0004$$$::Lancer waves goodbye and returns to his fishing spot.::
22103::$$$message_0172_0011_0000$$$::"Uh[line len=3]wait, hold on...!"[lr]::
22104::$$$message_0172_0011_0001$$$::"What? Is there still more?"[lr]::
22105::$$$message_0172_0011_0002$$$::"Well, no... But, are you really sure?[lr]::
22106::$$$message_0172_0011_0003$$$::I'm the one who asked you, but you don't kill women or lords, right?"::
22107::$$$message_0172_0012_0000$$$::"Forget about such small things. I can't enjoy life if I'm bound to your words."[lr]::
22108::$$$message_0172_0012_0001$$$::"...Mrgh."[lr]::
22109::$$$message_0172_0012_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Look who's talking.[font italic=false][lr]::
22110::$$$message_0172_0012_0003$$$::[font italic=true]Who's the one who was protecting those small things?[font italic=false]::
22111::$$$message_0172_0013_0000$$$::"...Lancer. You receive a penalty if you break your Geis, right? Are you sure it's okay to break two of them?"[lr]::
22112::$$$message_0172_0013_0001$$$::The last of the mythology.[lr]::
22113::$$$message_0172_0013_0002$$$::Cú Chulainn ate dog meat, aware that it was another of Medb's schemes, and lost the use of his left arm.::
22114::$$$message_0172_0014_0000$$$::"It's not like it's forbidden, so I should be fine.[lr]::
22115::$$$message_0172_0014_0001$$$::I didn't mention this, but supposedly what Culann's guard dog protected in the very end was his friend's glory.[lr]::
22116::$$$message_0172_0014_0002$$$::...How troublesome. Then, I won't look cool if I don't protect it no matter what, right?"[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
22117::$$$message_0172_0015_0000$$$::Lancer laughs sarcastically and disappears into the wharf.::
22118::$$$message_0172_0016_0000$$$::...Culann's guard dog's last moment.[lr]::
22119::$$$message_0172_0016_0001$$$::As he was surrounded by Queen Medb's army, the minstrels sang to him.[lr]::
22120::$$$message_0172_0016_0002$$$::Give us your spear. If you do not, we will sing of your shame.[lr]::
22121::$$$message_0172_0016_0003$$$::In this age, the poems of the minstrels were known as the truth to the public even if they were false.[lr]::
22122::$$$message_0172_0016_0004$$$::Cú Chulainn gave his spear to the minstrels, and the spear that was handed to the enemies continued to take away the things important to Cú Chulainn.::
22123::$$$message_0172_0017_0000$$$::There were three minstrels.[lr]::
22124::$$$message_0172_0017_0001$$$::The first one sought Cú Chulainn's glory,[lr]::
22125::$$$message_0172_0017_0002$$$::the second one sought for his spear in the name of Ulster.[lr]::
22126::$$$message_0172_0017_0003$$$::Then the third one.[lr]::
22127::$$$message_0172_0017_0004$$$::The minstrels sang to Cú Chulainn, who lost his coachman and his beloved horse, to give his spear again.::
22128::$$$message_0172_0018_0000$$$::"I have no more spears to give.[lr]::
22129::$$$message_0172_0018_0001$$$::I've already long paid the price for my own glory and Ulster's glory."[lr]::
22130::$$$message_0172_0018_0002$$$::Cú Chulainn exclaimed.::
22131::$$$message_0172_0019_0000$$$::To that...[lr]::
22132::$$$message_0172_0019_0001$$$::"I see, I see. Then we shall sing the shame of your family and the ones you love."[lr]::
22133::$$$message_0172_0019_0002$$$::The minstrels sang back while laughing.::
22134::$$$message_0172_0020_0000$$$::To this proposal, Culann's guard dog laughed out loud and gave his last spear saying that it can't be helped.[lr]::
22135::$$$message_0172_0020_0001$$$::The spear was handed over to the enemy and was said to have pierced the guard dog's stomach at last.::
22136::$$$message_0172_0021_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
22137::$$$message_0172_0021_0001$$$::I don't know what Lancer is helping me out for, but we've finished preparing.[lr]::
22138::$$$message_0172_0021_0002$$$::Under the hazy moon.[lr]::
22139::$$$message_0172_0021_0003$$$::One thing will be settled at the church at night.::
922119::$$$message_9172_0016_0001$$$::As he was surrounded by Queen Medb's army, the minstrels sang to him.[r]:��A